  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mungaila Dairy Cooperative Society Milk Expansion Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Dairy farming.Location: Mungaila, Southern Province.Description: Grant will improve chilling capacity for milk from animals that move during the dry season, and improve transportation to deliver milk to the collection point. Mungaila will upgrade beef animals into dairy crosses that will increase milk production and thus farmer incomes. An input fund will support farmers.</narrative>
  </description>
